{"version":2,"slug":"dog-park-edition-learnenglish-dog-capcut-englishspeaking","videoId":"-KH6gQsVxDc","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/-KH6gQsVxDc","lang":"en","title":"Dog park edition! #learnenglish #dog #capcut #englishspeaking","category":"Vlog","channel":"Learn english with me (slowly)","channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/@BoSlowEnglish","captionSource":"auto","tags":["Video","easy English","tv series"],"backUrl":"/","lines":[{"start":8,"text":"Hi everyone. Welcome to a new episode of"},{"start":13,"text":"Bow's Slow English. Here I am with my"},{"start":17,"text":"dog Nari."},{"start":19,"text":"Nari."},{"start":20,"text":"Say hi to the camera."},{"start":25,"text":"She's a little nervous."},{"start":28,"text":"We're at the dog park."},{"start":30,"text":"And"},{"start":32,"text":"we'll see if she will"},{"start":34,"text":"make some friends today."},{"start":41,"text":"There's a lot of big dogs today, so I'm"},{"start":44,"text":"not sure if she will cooperate. We shall"},{"start":47,"text":"see."},{"start":58,"text":"I think it would be best if we"},{"start":62,"text":"moved away from the big dogs for now."},{"start":66,"text":"So"},{"start":68,"text":"we'll go to the corner over there where"},{"start":70,"text":"there's two benches, so we can sit down"},{"start":73,"text":"and relax."},{"start":85,"text":"Let's go."},{"start":88,"text":"We are at"},{"start":90,"text":"a large"},{"start":92,"text":"old baseball field"},{"start":94,"text":"that is converted into a dog park. We"},{"start":99,"text":"like to come here because there's open"},{"start":102,"text":"space"},{"start":104,"text":"for Nari to run."},{"start":106,"text":"And she usually likes to only be around"},{"start":110,"text":"small dogs, so if we see big dogs, we"},{"start":115,"text":"get to have our own area."},{"start":118,"text":"Nari is very curious."},{"start":122,"text":"So she's sniffing everything in sight."},{"start":128,"text":"I haven't walked her today, so I'm going"},{"start":132,"text":"to take her for a little jog."},{"start":135,"text":"Come on, Nari."},{"start":143,"text":"I see a big dog coming."},{"start":145,"text":"So I'm going to put the leash back on"},{"start":148,"text":"just in case she decides to run."},{"start":152,"text":"Nari."},{"start":154,"text":"Come here."},{"start":161,"text":"Nari has"},{"start":164,"text":"black"},{"start":165,"text":"polka dots"},{"start":167,"text":"on the white part of her fur."},{"start":172,"text":"Today she is wearing a red harness."},{"start":178,"text":"As you can see"},{"start":180,"text":"she is going to mark her territory."},{"start":184,"text":"She does this everywhere we go."},{"start":190,"text":"She's a very busy dog."},{"start":198,"text":"That's a big pitbull."},{"start":201,"text":"Kind of same coloring as Nari."},{"start":209,"text":"This dog over here"},{"start":211,"text":"that just grabbed the tennis ball also"},{"start":214,"text":"has similar coloring to Nari."},{"start":221,"text":"Maybe Nari will make a friend today."},{"start":234,"text":"She needs to make friends."},{"start":238,"text":"What kind of dog do you have?"},{"start":240,"text":"So cute. Very friendly."},{"start":252,"text":"That over there is an Australian"},{"start":255,"text":"Shepherd."},{"start":258,"text":"This dog is incredibly agile"},{"start":263,"text":"and has great"},{"start":266,"text":"I guess"},{"start":267,"text":"mouth eye coordination"},{"start":271,"text":"when fetching the frisbee."},{"start":279,"text":"It's"},{"start":281,"text":"pretty cold today. Well I guess for LA"},{"start":285,"text":"standards"},{"start":287,"text":"it feels cold. As you can see it's"},{"start":290,"text":"pretty gloomy."},{"start":292,"text":"Next month is June."},{"start":294,"text":"And there is a saying in Los Angeles"},{"start":296,"text":"called June gloom."},{"start":299,"text":"And we're not in June yet, but it"},{"start":302,"text":"certainly feels like June gloom."},{"start":306,"text":"The sky is gray."},{"start":309,"text":"The temperature feels like"},{"start":313,"text":"62°"},{"start":315,"text":"Fahrenheit."},{"start":319,"text":"Last weekend"},{"start":321,"text":"it was"},{"start":323,"text":"much warmer."},{"start":325,"text":"And I did not have to wear"},{"start":329,"text":"a thick jacket."},{"start":332,"text":"We're thinking about what to eat for"},{"start":334,"text":"dinner. Tonight we're thinking"},{"start":337,"text":"Korean"},{"start":338,"text":"Japanese"},{"start":340,"text":"Mexican"},{"start":342,"text":"Here is another"},{"start":345,"text":"soccer goal"},{"start":347,"text":"with"},{"start":348,"text":"torn up net."},{"start":351,"text":"There are"},{"start":353,"text":"three German Shepherds."},{"start":357,"text":"One German Shepherd has a pink ball in"},{"start":361,"text":"its mouth."},{"start":363,"text":"There's also"},{"start":365,"text":"a Schnauzer"},{"start":368,"text":"and possibly a black lab."},{"start":374,"text":"Hello."},{"start":376,"text":"I think this is a black German Shepherd."},{"start":379,"text":"Let's see how Nari does."},{"start":381,"text":"Hi."},{"start":383,"text":"So sweet."},{"start":385,"text":"Hello."},{"start":387,"text":"Very sweet dog."},{"start":391,"text":"Look at how beautiful the coat is."},{"start":395,"text":"Jet black"},{"start":397,"text":"with brown paws"},{"start":400,"text":"white baseball"},{"start":402,"text":"in its mouth."},{"start":406,"text":"Sweet dog."},{"start":409,"text":"The dog's tail is wagging back and"},{"start":413,"text":"forth."},{"start":415,"text":"It has coloring"},{"start":418,"text":"of a cow."},{"start":423,"text":"Does anybody know"},{"start":425,"text":"what this"},{"start":426,"text":"tree or plant is called?"},{"start":429,"text":"I've never seen such big leaves."},{"start":433,"text":"I think it's as big as my head. Let's"},{"start":435,"text":"see."},{"start":441,"text":"Yes, it is."},{"start":451,"text":"I think those dogs are"},{"start":454,"text":"related."},{"start":456,"text":"Especially the black and white ones."},{"start":461,"text":"They have a very similar coat"},{"start":464,"text":"and coloring."},{"start":484,"text":"Like a large Schnauzer? Sort of, yeah."},{"start":487,"text":"Uh it's a black Russian terrier."},{"start":489,"text":"Beautiful."},{"start":492,"text":"He's 1 year? Yeah."},{"start":495,"text":"So he'll grow? Yeah. He'll get another"},{"start":497,"text":"30 lbs probably. 30 lbs?"},{"start":500,"text":"So is that bigger than a Great Dane? Uh"},{"start":502,"text":"they've got a little Dane in them."},{"start":504,"text":"It's a"},{"start":505,"text":"Russian military took giant Schnauzer"},{"start":507,"text":"and crossed it with 15 or 16 other dogs."},{"start":509,"text":"Incredible. Yeah, they're fun."},{"start":512,"text":"Wow. He is energetic puppy."},{"start":515,"text":"I think"},{"start":516,"text":"this man must be a dog trainer or a dog"},{"start":521,"text":"walker."},{"start":522,"text":"We have a beautiful"},{"start":525,"text":"black dog that approached us."},{"start":528,"text":"I have a black pitbull over here."},{"start":537,"text":"Okay."},{"start":540,"text":"Thanks for watching. I hope you found"},{"start":543,"text":"this video to be useful. And I'd really"},{"start":547,"text":"appreciate it if you would like and"},{"start":549,"text":"subscribe to my channel. And I hope to"},{"start":554,"text":"see you next time. Thank you."}]}